# Allow only sanitized documentation here; exclude photos, previews, raw output,
# journals, alternate manifests, and any future private benchmark artifacts.
/benchmarks/phone-photo-v1/*
!/benchmarks/phone-photo-v1/README.md
!/benchmarks/phone-photo-v1/RESULTS.md
# Runtime reports and previews also remain covered by /debug_outputs/ above.
